*> PLB-Q014 fetch-loop-end-only: a FETCH loop that ends only when
*> SQLCODE is 100.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FTLOOP.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
    EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA END-EXEC.
01  WS-NAME             PIC X(30).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    EXEC SQL DECLARE C1 CURSOR FOR SELECT NAME FROM CUSTOMER END-EXEC
    EXEC SQL OPEN C1 END-EXEC
    *> Reported.
    PERFORM UNTIL SQLCODE = 100
        EXEC SQL FETCH C1 INTO :WS-NAME END-EXEC
        DISPLAY WS-NAME
    END-PERFORM
    *> Not reported: SQLCODE looked at in the loop.
    PERFORM UNTIL SQLCODE = 100
        EXEC SQL FETCH C1 INTO :WS-NAME END-EXEC
        IF SQLCODE < 0
            DISPLAY "FETCH FAILED " SQLCODE
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM
    EXEC SQL CLOSE C1 END-EXEC
    GOBACK.
